    "title": "World's oldest person, 116, meets King Charles - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cash Murphy South East ,\n24 days ago King Charles III has made a special visit to the world's oldest person, who told him she remembered \"all the girls were in love with you and wanted to marry you\". Ethel Caterham, 116, lives in a care home in Lightwater, Surrey, and is the last surviving subject of Edward VII. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
